[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0860","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0860.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0700","title":"Cisco Gigabit Switch Routers ACL 安全绕过漏洞","description":"思科 GSR（Gigabit Switch Router）系列路由器运行特定 IOS 版本时，对线卡故障处理存在缺陷，远程攻击者可利用该缺陷绕过 ACL（访问控制列表）或导致接口停止转发数据包，造成安全策略失效或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 IOS 11.2(15)GS1A 至 11.2(19)GS0.2 及部分 12.0 版本的 GSR 设备，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0700"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:17.820","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.0(5)XG 或更高版本，该版本修复了线卡故障处理逻辑。如无法升级，可在接口下配置 ACL 并启用 ip unreachables 增强过滤，同时监控 linecard 状态日志以及时发现异常故障。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/gsraclbypassdos-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/793","http://www.osvdb.org/798","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1541","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0700.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0700.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0700","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0700.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0700.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v7r2-f6jx-59j6/GHSA-v7r2-f6jx-59j6.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/CSCdp35794.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1541/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--69531476-f99d-4197-8187-9737bd2f144c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0860.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0859","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0859.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0694","title":"Raptor GFX pgxconfig 配置工具本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Raptor GFX 配置工具中的 pgxconfig 组件存在符号链接攻击漏洞，本地用户可通过创建恶意符号链接诱使该工具以提升的权限操作目标文件，从而获取系统最高权限。该漏洞源于程序在处理临时文件时未对符号链接做安全检查，攻击者只需拥有本地访问权限即可利用，严重影响系统安全性。目前官方已发布修复版本，建议用户升级。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0694"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:17.067","remediation":"立即移除 pgxconfig 的 setuid/setgid 权限位（chmod u-s /path/to/pgxconfig），防止普通用户以更高权限执行该程序。如业务不需要该工具，直接卸载 Raptor GFX 软件包。若需保留功能，建议使用 mkstemp 等安全临时文件创建方式重写 pgxconfig 中涉及 /tmp 临时文件写入的代码，避免使用不可预测的固定路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0463.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5740","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0694.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0694","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0694.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0694.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9wmx-j898-fr8m/GHSA-9wmx-j898-fr8m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0694.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/ee86c26ee0202761283d7d612909ed4cc8981bf7/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0859.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0858","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0858.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0693","title":"Tech-Source Raptor GFX PGX32 Config Tool 本地任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Tech-Source Raptor GFX PGX32 配置工具中的 pgxconfig 程序在调用系统命令 \"cp\" 时使用了相对路径而非绝对路径，导致本地攻击者可通过修改 PATH 环境变量指向恶意的 \"cp\" 程序来劫持该调用，从而以配置工具的权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Raptor GFX PGX32 2.3.1 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0693"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16.943","remediation":"使用绝对路径调用系统命令（如将 `cp` 改为 `/bin/cp`）即可修复此漏洞。临时缓解措施：限制 `pgxconfig` 的执行权限（仅授予受信任用户），并确保 `PATH` 环境变量中不含未授权的可写目录。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0463.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1501","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1563","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0693.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0693","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0693.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0693.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f3h8-8rx5-4v78/GHSA-f3h8-8rx5-4v78.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0693.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--23de6c64-641a-4f00-ac59-8e60f902d9d6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0858.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0857","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0857.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0692","title":"ISS RealSecure 3.2.1/3.2.2 SYN分片数据包洪泛拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ISS RealSecure 入侵检测系统 3.2.1 及 3.2.2 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标系统发送大量设置了 SYN 标志的 IP 分片数据包，可导致 RealSecure 服务耗尽系统资源而崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击条件低，影响运行上述版本的 ISS RealSecure 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0692"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16.817","remediation":"升级 ISS RealSecure 至 3.2.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了分片 SYN 报文洪流处理逻辑。如无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙或路由器上配置速率限制策略，对入站 SYN 包进行限速，并启用碎片重组检测以缓解攻击。该产品已停止支持，建议迁移至现代入侵检测/防御系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0267.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1597","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0692.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0692","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0692.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0692.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g572-wc44-wvcc/GHSA-g572-wc44-wvcc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0692.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--10fc98e4-0c3e-4d34-80e2-cb82097cf87e.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0857.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0854","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0854.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0686","title":"Auction Weaver CGI 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Auction Weaver CGI 脚本 1.03 及更早版本存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 fromfile 参数提交包含 `..` 的恶意请求读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，影响运行 Auction Weaver CGI 脚本的 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0686"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16.047","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 auction_weaver CGI 脚本，该产品已停止维护且无安全更新。如业务必须使用，需在 Web 服务器层面对 fromfile 参数进行输入过滤，拒绝包含 \"../\" 或 \"..\\\" 等路径遍历字符的请求，并限制 CGI 脚本的文件系统访问权限。建议迁移至其他受支持的竞品替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0310.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1630","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0686.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0686","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0686.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0686.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jghw-mw88-pq53/GHSA-jghw-mw88-pq53.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0686.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1630/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0854.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0854.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0854.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0852","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0852.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0683","title":"BEA WebLogic SSIServlet 源代码读取漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic 5.1.x 版本中的 SSIServlet 存在源代码泄露漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过在 URL 中插入 `/*.shtml/` 路径后缀来触发该漏洞，导致服务端解析后的页面源码（如 JSP 文件）被直接读取泄露。该漏洞可造成敏感业务逻辑与数据库凭据等关键信息暴露，攻击者利用难度较低，仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可实现利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0683"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15.643","remediation":"升级 BEA WebLogic 至 5.1.x 的安全修补版本（如 Service Pack 2 及以上），或禁用 SSIServlet 映射（从 web.xml 中移除 *.shtml 的 Servlet 映射）。如无法升级，可在反向代理或防火墙层拦截包含 `/*.shtml/` 的请求路径作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0410.html","http://developer.bea.com/alerts/security_000728.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1480","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1517","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0683.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0683","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0683.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0683.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9j8w-xrww-p6wr/GHSA-9j8w-xrww-p6wr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/B/BEA_weblogic_Reveal_Script_Code_3.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0683.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--60648868-1388-40b1-881f-05b075c6e171.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0852.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0852.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0852.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0841","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0841.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0682","title":"BEA WebLogic 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic 5.1.x 存在源代码泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过在 URL 中插入 \"/ConsoleHelp/\" 路径即可触发 FileServlet 错误解析机制，使服务器返回 JSP 等页面的原始源代码而非执行结果。攻击者可借此获取数据库连接凭证、业务逻辑及配置信息，为后续攻击提供跳板。该漏洞仅影响部署了 ConsoleHelp 功能的 WebLogic 5.1.x 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0682"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15.503","remediation":"升级到 BEA WebLogic 5.1.0 Service Pack 2 或更高版本。如无法升级，编辑 weblogic.properties 文件，移除 weblogic.httpd.register.FileServlet 注册项，或在 weblogic.httpd.initArgs 中限制 FileServlet 仅服务于特定目录，同时禁用 /ConsoleHelp/ 路径的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0410.html","http://developer.bea.com/alerts/security_000731.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1481","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1518","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0682.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0682","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0682.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0682.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a506