.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0678.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0678.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0678","https://github.com/hannob/pgpbugs/blob/859cc2bbb9272e193073e43d844db932b0866d33/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0678.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0678.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2rmh-3vpc-xqrj/GHSA-2rmh-3vpc-xqrj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0678.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0835.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0598","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0598.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0798","title":"SGI IRIX xfs truncate 权限检查漏洞","description":"IRIX 6.x 系统中 xfs 文件系统的 truncate 函数存在权限检查缺失漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 xfs 文件系统中的任意文件调用 truncate 操作，由于系统未正确验证用户权限，导致攻击者能够清空目标文件内容，造成数据丢失或服务异常。该漏洞影响 IRIX 6.2、6.3、6.4 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需特殊权限即可利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0798"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30.190","remediation":"SGI 已于 2006 年停止支持 IRIX，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即将受影响的 IRIX 6.2/6.3/6.4 系统升级至 IRIX 6.5（该版本已修复 truncate() 权限检查问题）；如无法升级，可通过 chmod 移除普通用户对 xfs 文件系统中敏感文件的写权限，并限制本地用户登录以降低攻击面。长期方案是迁移至受支持的 