ub.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0598.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0597","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0597.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0797","title":"SGI IRIX gr_osview 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IRIX 6.2 及 6.3 系统中的 gr_osview 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于程序未对用户通过 -D 选项传入的超长参数进行长度校验，导致栈缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者无需任何认证即可利用该漏洞，通过精心构造的超长参数触发溢出，覆盖返回地址，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.2 和 6.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。目前已存在公开的本地利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0797"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30.063","remediation":"立即应用 SGI 安全公告 20040104-01-P 提供的补丁，升级 gr_osview 至修复版本。如无法升级，可移除 /usr/sbin/gr_osview 的 setuid root 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/gr_osview），限制本地非授权用户通过 -D 参数触发缓冲区溢出提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/3815","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1526","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200008021924.e72JOVs12558%40ix.put.poznan.pl","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5062","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20126","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0797.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0797","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0797.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0797.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3b3e0c6dace1e53ea2fb8cc49db3e38b834c9179/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f9qw-pwjf-w5cp/GHSA-f9qw-pwjf-w5cp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","h