18e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0796","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0796.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0796.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0b54eddb6b01c4a2bdae016ba668128b1a8b9336/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fccg-7wjg-c6px/GHSA-fccg-7wjg-c6px.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0796.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--820f8f1e-5d55-48bb-9380-e9150bd0c1ef.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0596.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0594","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0594.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0795","title":"SGI IRIX lpstat 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IRIX 操作系统中 /usr/bin/lpstat 工具存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。lpstat 程序在处理 -n 参数时未对用户输入长度进行有效边界检查，导致攻击者可通过传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据。本地攻击者利用该漏洞可获取 root 权限，实现完全控制目标系统。攻击条件要求拥有本地 shell 访问权限，无需身份认证即可提权。该漏洞影响 IRIX 6.2 及 6.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0795"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29.807","remediation":"立即升级到 IRIX 6.5.11 或更高版本，该版本已修复 lpstat 缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可临时移除 /usr/bin/lpstat 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/lpstat），限制本地非授权用户执行该程序。由于 SGI IRIX 已停止维护，建议尽快迁移至受支持的操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1485","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1529","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200008021924.e72JOVs12558%40ix.put.poznan.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20129","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0795.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0795","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0795.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0795.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fc954c015ec74fa656f6d2cb3eaa86c83e860239/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v82r-qjrq-95w9/GHSA-v82r-qjrq-95w9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0795.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4a3ac1a3-6b3c-4c09-8853-23b63ac581ed.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0594.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0593","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0593.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0794","title":"SGI IRIX libgl.so 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.2 系统中的 libgl.so 动态链接库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 HOME 环境变量，并调用依赖该库的 setuid 程序（如 gmemusage 和 gr_osview），触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.2 及可能的相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可提权至 root，完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0794"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29.680","remediation":"SGI IRIX 6.2 已停止维护多年，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即迁移至受支持的操作系统。临时缓解措施：以 root 身份执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/gmemusage /usr/sbin/gr_osview` 移除受影响程序的 setuid 权限位，阻断提权路径；同时严格限制本地用户登录权限，仅允许可信用户访问系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5063.php","http://www.osvdb.org/8568","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1527","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200008021924.e72JOVs12558%40ix.put.poznan.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20127","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0794.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0794","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0794.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0794.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0f14531dae9947fef349fa696ac83d6fc56f601e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g2cj-p4q5-49m4/GHSA-g2cj-p4q5-49m4.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0794.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d85485c0-98ae-48b9-b684-c175ee5c2e65.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0593.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0591","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0591.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0787","title":"X-Chat IRC客户端URL命令执行漏洞","description":"IRC 聊天客户端 X-Chat 1.4.2 及更早版本存在命令执行漏洞。当用户点击聊天消息中的 URL 时，X-Chat 会调用系统默认浏览器打开该链接，但未能对 URL 中的 shell 元字符（如反引号、管道符等）进行有效过滤。远程攻击者可以构造包含恶意 shell 命令的特制 URL 发送给目标用户，当用户点击该 URL 时，嵌入的恶意命令将在用户系统上以当前用户权限执行，导致信息泄露、系统被控等严重后果。该漏洞攻击条件低，无需认证，利用方式简单，影响所有使用受影响版本的 X-Chat 用户。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0787"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28.807","remediation":"升级 X-Chat 至 1.4.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复通过 URL 编码 shell 元字符执行任意命令的问题。如无法升级，可在 X-Chat 设置中禁用自动打开 URL 功能，或使用防火墙规则阻止 IRC 端口（6667）的异常出站连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0215.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0301.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0305.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-055.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1601","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20161","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0787.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0787","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0787.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0787.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9608541b971a314a928294c8f88371b45ef3f307/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9wr3-8fv2-9fcj/GHSA-9wr3-8fv2-9fcj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/gitter-badger/IRCScanner/blob/07d36e3e51c497f1a76a291a76493a2e6cbef0e4/sploit.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6547a08a-ed3a-4fe0-b8a9-7e486ad40e73.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0787.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0591.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0590","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0590.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0782","title":"Netwin Netauth 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Netwin Netauth 4.2e 及更早版本的 netauth.cgi 程序存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的特制 HTTP 请求，利用路径回溯技术读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Netwin Netauth 4.2e 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0782"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28.203","remediation":"建议立即升级 Netwin Netauth 至 4.2e 以上版本，该版本已修复 netauth.cgi 的路径遍历漏洞。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/IIS）层面配置 URL 重写规则，拦截包含 `..` 的请求路径，并对 `netauth.cgi` 的 `template` 等参数做严格的白名单校验，禁止包含 `../` 的输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://netwinsite.com/netauth/updates.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1587","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=NEBBJCLKGNOGCOIOBJNAGEHLCPAA.marc%40eeye.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5090","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20156","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0782.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0782","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0782.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0782.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7c78b01f402841eaeb570a26d276cd67a60a9531/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vwr7-jw8x-3pcx/GHSA-vwr7-jw8x-3pcx.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/b49c6ea2ab1d18335135f04a4ae84f6b2f615328/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/netauth.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0782.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0590.toml"}]